@base = http://localhost:8080
@origin = http://localhost:8080
@password = Demo-EczaNet-2026!
@barcode = 0012345678901
@asOf = 2026-10-26
@suggestionId = 1
@allocationId = 1
# Replace suggestionId/allocationId with IDs returned by the preceding calculate/order calls.

### Readiness (DB included)
GET {{base}}/health

### Liveness
GET {{base}}/_hz/a339

### Technical Prometheus metrics; local demo public
GET {{base}}/metrics

### 1. CSRF preparation (REST Client must retain response cookies)
# @name prepare
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/csrf

### 2. Login with prelogin cookie from prepare
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{prepare.response.body.$.csrf_token}}

{"email":"seed.yildiz@ddo-case.invalid","password":"{{password}}"}

### 3. Current account
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/me

### Assigned locations
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/locations

### Allowed scoped read
GET {{base}}/api/v1/locations/1

### Foreign scope must return 403
GET {{base}}/api/v1/locations/2

### 4. Logout with session-bound CSRF returned by login
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{login.response.body.$.csrf_token}}

### 5. Must now return 401
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/me

### A2 manual journey. Change @run for each new intention; keep it on retries.
@run = manual-a2-001

### Warehouse CSRF after previous logout
# @name warehousePrep
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/csrf

### Warehouse login
# @name warehouseLogin
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{warehousePrep.response.body.$.csrf_token}}

{"email":"depo@ddo-case.invalid","password":"{{password}}"}

### Suppliers
GET {{base}}/api/v1/suppliers?limit=50

### Targets (warehouse only)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/transfer-targets?limit=50

### Create product. Replace barcode if already used by another intention.
# @name product
POST {{base}}/api/v1/products
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{warehouseLogin.response.body.$.csrf_token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{run}}-product

{"location_id":"21","product":{"barcode":"{{barcode}}","name":"MANUAL BASIC-TAB","dose":"5 mg","form":"tablet","base_unit":"tablet","pack_size":"10","blister_size":"5","sale_multiple":"1","ingredients":["demo"],"pack_price":"1000"}}

### Catalog search; use next_cursor from response for next page. Scope changes ->400.
GET {{base}}/api/v1/products?q={{barcode}}&limit=50

### Receive 10 base units. Same supplier/document with new key still one receipt.
# @name receipt
POST {{base}}/api/v1/goods-receipts
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{warehouseLogin.response.body.$.csrf_token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{run}}-receipt

{"location_id":"21","supplier_id":"1","document_no":"{{run}}","reason":"Siparissiz demo kabul","lines":[{"product_id":"{{product.response.body.$.id}}","lot":"E","expires_on":"2099-12-31","quantity":"10"}]}

### Warehouse lot/account balances
GET {{base}}/api/v1/inventory?location_id=21&limit=50

### Draft transfer 6 units
