# @name a5warehouselogin
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{a5warehouseprepare.response.body.$.csrf_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"depo@ddo-case.invalid","password":"{{password}}"}

### Warehouse sets a real allocation ETA (allocationId must be copied from A4 order projection)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/allocations/{{allocationId}}/eta
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{a5warehouselogin.response.body.$.csrf_token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{run}}-a5-eta
Content-Type: application/json

{"location_id":"21","expected_on":"{{asOf}}"}

### A6 live dashboard (warehouse scope; no branch1 event detail)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/dashboard
